# Keep documentation out of the build context. The packages/ directory is deliberately
# NOT ignored: the Dockerfile bind-mounts it to read a local .deb, and an ignored file is
# absent from the context, so the bind mount would see nothing and the offline build would
# fall back to a network download. A local .deb never becomes an image layer anyway, since
# it is bind-mounted rather than copied. .gitignore keeps it out of version control.
*.md
